{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>As a first-offering you shall offer them to HaShem.</b> Like the sense of \"two loaves of two-tenths\" that are waved before HaShem on the festival of Shavuot, and this is the meaning of \"to HaShem\": even though they are holy to HaShem, they are for the priest's consumption."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:08:30.488674451Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}